<section class="rural">
<h2>🌾 No veterinarian nearby?</h2>
<p>Living in a rural or remote community can make accessing emergency veterinary care difficult.</p>
<ol>
<li>Call the nearest veterinary hospital, even if it is far away.</li>
<li>Explain the animal's symptoms and when they began.</li>
<li>Follow professional instructions while arranging safe transportation.</li>
<li>Prepare the animal's age, approximate weight, medications and possible exposure history.</li>
<li>Do not give human medications or attempt invasive procedures without veterinary direction.</li>
</ol>
<p>Online information cannot replace a veterinary assessment.</p>
</section>

